### Route block — `layout` mode (one per route; name regions, order, what hides, CTA position)
```
### R-nn <route path> — <Page name>
- Role / access:   <who>
- Purpose:         <the one primary job>
- Layout concept:  <pattern + why it is the recommended fit>
- Mobile (<768):   <regions top→bottom · nav · primary CTA · sheets/drawers>
- Tablet (768–1023): <columns/panes · nav · what appears that mobile hid>
- Desktop (≥1024): <columns/panes · sidebar/top bar · density · hover/keyboard extras>
- Table / list:    <mobile card list · tablet condensed table + drawer · desktop full table>
- Transition:      <mobile push|sheet|fade|none · tablet … · desktop …  (transitions.mdc §2; entering + leaving/back)>
- Components:      <catalog components used, with variants: Card(interactive) · DataTable · FilterBar …>
- Overrides:       <Component → classes / classNames.slot → why  (ui-components.mdc §1b) — or "none">
- States:          <loading skeleton shape · empty · error>
- Notes:           <sticky elements · infinite scroll vs pagination · safe-area · gestures (edge-swipe back, pull-to-refresh)>
```

### Route block — `normal` mode
```
### R-nn <route path> — <Page name>
- Role / access · Purpose · Layout concept: <as above, single composition>
- Reflow:          <columns at base / md / lg · what stacks · what hides/collapses>
- Nav:             <navbar → menu button at what width>
- Transition:      <fade (normal mode: crossfade only)>
- Components / Overrides: <as above, or "none">
- Table / list:    <horizontal scroll with sticky first column, or stacked rows>
- States:          <loading skeleton shape · empty · error>
```

